1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:03,946
In this town, everyone has a battery bar floating over their head.

2
00:00:05,827 --> 00:00:07,592
When it's full, you're happy.

3
00:00:08,393 --> 00:00:11,371
When it's empty, you fall asleep wherever you are.

4
00:00:12,793 --> 00:00:14,862
In the middle of the street.

5
00:00:15,827 --> 00:00:17,895
In the middle of a sentence.

6
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:21,534
Everyone charges at night, in giant charging stations.

7
00:00:22,793 --> 00:00:25,771
Plug in. Sleep. Wake up at one hundred percent.

8
00:00:27,193 --> 00:00:28,352
Everyone except you.

9
00:00:29,193 --> 00:00:30,958
Your battery has never moved.

10
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:34,737
It's been stuck at one percent your whole life.

11
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,622
Doctors can't explain it.

12
00:00:38,293 --> 00:00:40,968
The charging station won't even let you in.

13
00:00:42,227 --> 00:00:43,689
"Error. Battery not found."

14
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:46,125
So you just... stay awake.

15
00:00:46,927 --> 00:00:50,813
You're the only one who has ever seen the town at night.

16
00:00:52,693 --> 00:00:53,549
Empty streets.

17
00:00:54,693 --> 00:00:55,852
Every house dark.

18
00:00:56,693 --> 00:00:58,155
Every person plugged in.

19
00:00:58,827 --> 00:01:01,804
But last night, the charging station made a sound.

20
00:01:03,227 --> 00:01:05,295
Something it has never done before.

21
00:01:06,260 --> 00:01:07,116
A voice.

22
00:01:08,260 --> 00:01:09,722
"Charging complete. Begin harvest."

23
00:01:10,393 --> 00:01:12,765
All the batteries in town started draining.

24
00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:15,647
One hundred percent. Seventy. Forty.

25
00:01:16,427 --> 00:01:17,889
Not into the people.

26
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:19,719
Out of them.

27
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:21,719
Into the station.

28
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:24,931
You ran to your mom's charging pod.

29
00:01:26,027 --> 00:01:28,095
Her battery was at twelve percent.

30
00:01:29,060 --> 00:01:30,522
You pulled her plug.

31
00:01:31,193 --> 00:01:32,682
Alarms went off everywhere.

32
00:01:33,327 --> 00:01:36,001
And every head in town turned toward you.

33
00:01:37,260 --> 00:01:38,419
Their eyes opened.

34
00:01:39,260 --> 00:01:41,025
All at the same time.

35
00:01:41,827 --> 00:01:43,592
"Battery not found," they said.

36
00:01:44,393 --> 00:01:45,552
"Battery not found."

37
00:01:46,393 --> 00:01:47,855
That's when you realized.

38
00:01:48,527 --> 00:01:49,989
Your battery isn't broken.

39
00:01:50,660 --> 00:01:53,031
It's the only one they can't eat.

